{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19243","headline":"怀妓 一 · 刘禹锡","name":"怀妓 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉钗重合两无缘，鱼在深潭鹤在天。\n得意紫鸾休舞镜，能言青鸟罢衔牋。\n金盆已覆难收水，玉轸长抛不续弦。\n若向蘼芜山下过，遥将红泪洒穷泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}